  "scope": "Executed synthetic host ordered/compact/residual/MTP probability operations and pristine/ON/OFF numerical/grammar/history fixtures. NOT-INFERENCE; no model forward, original-weight GPU continuation, fit or performance qualification.",
  "implementation": [
    "Model-neutral C17 ABI1 owns checked/stable normalization, ranking/lookup, raw-ID penalties for compact positions, positive p-q residual and host discrete proposal/verification arithmetic. Caller owns all storage/growth/budgets; no pointer retention, allocator, thread or device import.",
    "Ranked compact math preserves pinned top-k/top-p/min-p order, normalized cumulative rounding, logit min-p threshold and double normalization. Dense bias is not added to the pinned compact algorithm. Grammar may pre-mask rows but remains delegated.",
    "Sparse repeated IDs are sorted by raw ID and lossless original index, then accumulate FP64 in original occurrence order. Residual retains target order and falls back to target when empty.",
    "Exact F32 proposal masses sum to2^24 with remainder on first entry and always one draw. Acceptance draws once; residual draws only after rejection. Refusal preserves published result/RNG; ordinary target singleton uses no draw.",
    "Provider recipe applies exact15 edits after dense/history recipes. Vectors/options/errors remain transient glue; C17 ON excludes legacy numerical helpers, OFF retains numerical/draw behavior and equal layouts. Provider receipt binds9 owned sampling files and all3 extraction recipes.",
    "No executor/request/generation/persisted-state layout, DS4 framing, HTTP field, runtime thread or Python product/defaultCTest dependency changes. MTP controller, deferred correction and model/GPU ownership remain transitional."
  ],
  "coverage": [
    "2048 independent residual draw oracles over512 profiles and4 seeds; duplicated/out-of-support sparse IDs accumulate in original order, with full FP64 residual and independent xorshift/draw witnesses.",
    "768 independent proposal/verification draws plus singleton draw rule; mapped raw IDs, exact exported mass, accepted/rejected corrections, RNG and output preserved on invalid/resource refusal.",
    "Malformed sparse lengths/nonfinite/negative masses, aliasing input/output, too-short mapping, ABI/bounds errors and first/second allocation refusal are checked without weakening assertions.",
    "1728 compact/target profiles,6912 full MTP decisions,1024 raw residual draws and32 grammar-masked decisions match pristine Gufo and OFF byte-exactly for full FP64 rows/F32 q/token/RNG witnesses.",
    "Existing1200 numerical cases,1200 bias cases,24 full-vocabulary cases and1728 complete history transitions/48profiles still match;9 upstream logit/grammar/MTP fixtures and candidate/fallback controls pass.",
    "Final18 Debug,18 ASan/UBSan/LeakSanitizer shared-contract checks,16 sanitizer reference-project checks and34 public C++ headers pass. Strict C17 warning-as-error compilation and symbol audit pass."
  ],
